odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6295:3.1.2 <office:document>(Single OpenDocument XML Files)
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6297:The <office:document> element is the root element of a document in OpenDocument format which is represented as a single XML document. It contains the entire document. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6299:The <office:document> element is a root element.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6301:The <office:document> element is usable within the following elements: <db:component> 12.25.5 and <draw:object> 10.4.6.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6303:The <office:document> element has the following attributes: grddl:transformation 19.320, office:mimetype 19.379 and office:version 19.390.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6305:The <office:document> element has the following child elements: <office:automatic-styles> 3.15.3, <office:body> 3.3, <office:font-face-decls> 3.14, <office:master-styles> 3.15.4, <office:meta> 3.2, <office:scripts> 3.12, <office:settings> 3.10 and <office:styles> 3.15.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6315:3.1.3.2 <office:document-content>
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6317:The <office:document-content> root element contains document content and automatic styles used in a document. The file within a package for the <office:document-content> element is content.xml. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6319:The <office:document-content> element is a root element.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6321:The <office:document-content> element has the following attributes: grddl:transformation 19.320 and office:version 19.390.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6323:The <office:document-content> element has the following child elements: <office:automatic-styles> 3.15.3, <office:body> 3.3, <office:font-face-decls> 3.14 and <office:scripts> 3.12.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6325:3.1.3.3 <office:document-styles>
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6327:The <office:document-styles> root element contains styles used in document content and automatic styles used in styles. The file within a package for the <office:document-styles> element is styles.xml.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6329:The <office:document-styles> element is a root element.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6331:The <office:document-styles> element has the following attributes: grddl:transformation 19.320 and office:version 19.390.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6333:The <office:document-styles> element has the following child elements: <office:automatic-styles> 3.15.3, <office:font-face-decls> 3.14, <office:master-styles> 3.15.4 and <office:styles> 3.15.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6335:3.1.3.4 <office:document-meta>
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6337:The <office:document-meta> root element contains document metadata elements. The file within a package for the <office:document-meta> element is meta.xml.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6339:The <office:document-meta> element is a root element.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6341:The <office:document-meta> element has the following attributes: grddl:transformation 19.320 and office:version 19.390.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6343:The <office:document-meta> element has the following child element: <office:meta> 3.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6345:3.1.3.5 <office:document-settings>
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6347:The <office:document-settings> root element contains implementation-dependent settings. The file within a package for the <office:document-settings> element is settings.xml. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6349:The <office:document-settings> element is a root element.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6351:The <office:document-settings> element has the following attributes: grddl:transformation 19.320 and office:version 19.390.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6353:The <office:document-settings> element has the following child element: <office:settings> 3.10.
