odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:10860:•Contained in a child <office:document> element of this element.  
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:10870:The <draw:object> element has the following child elements: <math:math> 14.6 and <office:document> 3.1.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:10904:The <draw:plugin> element represents an external application that processes data with a specified media type.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:12054:A database component is referenced using the xlink:href attribute or it is contained in a child element of either a <office:document> or <math:math> element.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:12060:The <db:component> element has the following child elements: <math:math> 14.6 and <office:document> 3.1.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:17953:The draw:mime-type attribute specifies the MIME type of the media type that a plugin processes, or the MIME type of the image given by a <draw:image> element. Valid values for this attribute are those defined in accordance with §3.7 of [RFC2616], or registered in accordance with [RFC6838]. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:17955:Note: Additional information on MIME media types can be found at [MIMETYPES]. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:20515:The grddl:transformation attribute is usable with the following elements: <office:document> 3.1.2, <office:document-content> 3.1.3.2, <office:document-meta> 3.1.3.4, <office:document-settings> 3.1.3.5 and <office:document-styles> 3.1.3.3.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21317:19.379 office:mimetype
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21319:The office:mimetype attribute specifies the document type for a document that is contained in a single XML file. Its values are the MIME types that are used for the packaged variant of office documents.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21321:The office:mimetype attribute is usable with the following element: <office:document> 3.1.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21323:The office:mimetype attribute has the data type string 18.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21599:19.390 office:version
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21601:The office:version attribute identifies the version of the OpenDocument specification that defines the associated element, its schema, its complete content, and its interpretation. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21603:The office:version attribute shall be present in every <office:document>, <office:document-content>, <office:document-styles>, <office:document-meta>, and <office:document-settings> element in the XML documents that comprise an OpenDocument 1.4 document. The value of the office:version attribute shall be "1.4". 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21605:Note: The office:version attribute value was not required by OpenDocument specifications prior to 1.2.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21607:The office:version attribute is usable with the following elements: <office:document> 3.1.2, <office:document-content> 3.1.3.2, <office:document-meta> 3.1.3.4, <office:document-settings> 3.1.3.5 and <office:document-styles> 3.1.3.3.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21609:The only value of the office:version attribute is 1.4.
